5,1,1,talk,Rin,,Let's make this fun! I want to know how we actually start our days and if moving desks takes forever.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree we need data. I'm interested in the financial side and the physical layout.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We should be mindful of fairness. I want to see the staff survey and the badge records to understand actual usage.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shion,,Logic dictates we prioritize the environment. I'll be looking into the sound levels and the ergonomic notes.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I want us all to feel connected! I'll check the costs for power and network, and what the new joiners think!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, do you think the billing matters more than our morning mood?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"It determines the sustainability of the layout, Rin.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,Let's not get sidetracked. We need a basis for who sits where to avoid resentment.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shion,,"Resentment is a byproduct of discomfort. If the seat is wrong, the mood follows.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Yumi,,Everyone is so serious! Let's just make sure we can all talk to each other easily!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm still curious about those ""unplanned shuffles."" Maybe they were like a game!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,Or a sign of a failed plan.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,Exactly. We need to avoid repeating mistakes.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shion,,I'm more interested in the physical reality of the space than the history of its failures.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I just hope the power cables don't get in the way of us chatting!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Rin,,Okay! I've decided what to check. Let's see what we find!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,Agreed.,"{""words"":1,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,Let's proceed.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shion,,I'm ready.,"{""words"":2,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Yumi,,Yay! I can't wait to see the results!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
