30,2,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
31,2,,status,Rin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
32,2,,status,Shion,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
33,2,,status,Mizuki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Yumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Oh no! It takes way too long to set up every morning, and the shuffles are a total mess!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The billing is based on area, not people. We are paying for empty space we aren't using efficiently.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"The survey shows a huge divide in preference for window seats, and arrival times vary wildly. We can't just let ""first come"" decide.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shion,,"It seems the noise is concentrated near the door, and ergonomic settings are fragile. We cannot afford frequent moves.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Yumi,,Guess what! The new joiners learned so much just by listening to us! But moving the power cables is actually pretty expensive.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Yumi, if it's expensive, maybe we should just pick one spot and stay there? No more shuffling!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"If we optimize the area we use, we can potentially reduce the billing burden.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, efficiency is fine, but we must address the window seat issue. Some people will be in the dark.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shion,,"The ""dark"" is preferable to a noisy corridor. We should prioritize the quiet zones for those who stay put.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"But if we stay put forever, we might stop talking to the people sitting far away!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,I don't want to spend ten minutes every morning just plugging things in. That's like... a whole snack break!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,We should avoid any layout that requires expensive re-wiring of power and network.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"If we choose a layout where some seats are objectively worse, we need a fair system to rotate them.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shion,,"Rotation is illogical if it ruins the ergonomic setup. A ""perfect"" seat takes days to calibrate.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Yumi,,I really want us to be close! But I don't want the company to be sad about the cost.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,Let's pick the one that's the fastest and easiest!,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I'll support the option that balances cost and utility.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,I will vote for the option that acknowledges the disparity in seat quality.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shion,,I will vote for the one that ensures stability and acoustic comfort.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Yumi,,I'll vote for whatever lets us keep our team spirit high!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
